  "contentHtml": "<p>드디어</p><p>2024 스타브릿지 교사 모집 공고가 났습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>저희 재과만에서는</p><p>2022년에 김지향 선생님이 프로그램에 참여하셨습니다.</p><p><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/eXoO/79\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/eXoO/79</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/eXoO/79\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=eXoO&amp;datanum=79\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/eXoO/79\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/eXoO/79\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>이번 24년도 모집공고입니다.</p><p>아래의 링크 읽어보시고&#160;</p><p>참여 기회를 얻으시길 응원합니다!</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.kofac.re.kr/brd/board/386/L/menu/270?brdType=R&amp;bbIdx=39862\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.kofac.re.kr/brd/board/386/L/menu/270?brdType=R&amp;bbIdx=39862</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"한국과학창의재단\" data-og-description=\"한국과학창의재단은 과학중심 문화조성과 인재양성을 위한 현장정책 전문기관입니다.\" data-og-host=\"www.kofac.re.kr\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.kofac.re.kr/brd/board/386/L/menu/270?brdType=R&amp